Comment: 0,0:21:54.91,0:21:54.96,Blau drei E,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.60,0:01:34.86,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I was so desperate that I lost sight of everything but my goal.\fad(0,200)}Estaba tan desesperado que perdí de vista todo, \Nexcepto mi meta.{}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.84,0:01:43.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{About your mother's condition...}Respecto a la condición de tu madre...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.58,0:01:50.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If I may, are you her only family?}Si me permite preguntarle, ¿es su único familiar?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.15,0:01:52.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My parents are divorced.}Mis padres están divorciados.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.42,0:01:56.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My brother and father both live far away.}Tanto mi padre como mi hermano viven lejos.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.55,0:02:01.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then please get me in touch with one of them.}Entonces, por favor, déjeme contactarlos.{Shiki: Lo dejé tipo formal}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.68,0:02:05.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm the only family that can be here with her.}Soy el único familiar que puede estar aquí con ella.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.80,0:02:11.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She doesn't have any other relatives?}¿No tiene más parientes?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, it's just me.}No, solo yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.89,0:02:24.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm the only one who can be there for her right now.}Soy el único que puede estar aquí con ella ahora.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.94,0:02:39.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.92,0:02:41.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What did the doctor say?}¿Qué dijo el médico?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.70,0:02:46.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They'll need to do a few more tests to be sure.}Necesitarán hacer unas pruebas más para estar seguros.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.80,0:02:49.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just gotta wait and see, I guess.}Creo que solo tenemos que esperar.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.59,0:02:51.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Bueno.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.56,0:02:53.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How does your back feel?}¿Cómo está tu espalda?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's a lot better now.}Está mucho mejor.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.33,0:02:57.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The painkillers must be working.}Los analgésicos están funcionando.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.32,0:03:00.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wonder if it's a hernia.}Me pregunto si es una hernia.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.70,0:03:04.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I never knew they were supposed to hurt so much.}No sabía que dolerían tanto.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Goodness, what am I to do?}Santo cielo, ¿qué voy a hacer?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.38,0:03:14.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.63,0:03:19.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll be fine here, so head on home.}Estaré bien aquí, así que puedes volver a casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.98,0:03:25.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think I'm coming down with a cold, and I wouldn't want to get you sick.}Creo que estoy resfriada y no quiero que te enfermes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.09,0:03:31.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just a little longer couldn't...}¿No podría solo un poco más...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.19,0:03:41.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright, I guess I'll go. I need to pick you up some things for your stay, too.\fs50}Bueno, entonces me voy. \NTambién tengo que recoger unas cosas para tu estadía acá.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.71,0:03:43.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll go for today.}Me iré por hoy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.30,0:03:46.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See you tomorrow.}Nos vemos mañana.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See you then.}Nos vemos.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.45,0:04:00.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Your mother has lung cancer.}Tu madre tiene cáncer pulmonar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.57,0:04:04.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Her back pain implies that it's also metastasized to her bones.}El dolor en su espalda sugiere que el mismo se ha extendido hasta sus huesos.{Por alguna razón no me gusta "metastatizado"}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{From this...}Y...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.97,0:04:17.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's fine. I was able to act like usual around her.}Está bien, puedo actuar como siempre ante ella.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.76,0:04:35.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hello, Youichi? It's Mom.}¿Hola, Youichi? Habla mamá.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.77,0:04:40.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, Youichi. It looks like...}Lo siento, Youichi, parece que...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.44,0:04:44.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...I may not have much longer.}ya no me queda mucho tiempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.77,0:04:49.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou is trying his hardest to act like nothing's wrong.}Kou está haciendo lo posible para actuar como si nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yes, you're right.}Sí, tienes razón.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.88,0:04:57.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll speak to the doctor about it.}Hablaré con el médico de esto. {kind of hard to tell about this line}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Youichi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Please take care of Kou for me.}Por favor, cuida de Kou por mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.65,0:05:14.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{From this, the cancer appears to be in its terminal stages.}Y así, parece que su cáncer se encuentra en fase terminal.{Muchos "est"... en la línea}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{To be honest, there is no effective treatment.}Sinceramente, no hay un tratamiento efectivo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.77,0:05:25.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Your mother has half a year left, at best.}Tu madre tiene, como máximo, medio año más de vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.67,0:05:29.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Could...}Pude...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.94,0:05:34.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Could I have saved her if I'd realized it sooner?}¿Pude haberla salvado si me hubiese dado cuenta antes?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.10,0:05:38.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I wanted to put her mind at ease about the future,}Quería tranquilizarla respecto a mi futuro, { se refiere al futuro de Kou, así que lo escribí de modo más específico}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.35,0:05:42.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{so I spent almost all my free time studying}así que usé todo mi tiempo libre estudiando
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.99,0:05:47.39,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{to get into good high schools, colleges, and companies.}para entrar a una buena preparatoria, \Nuniversidad y compañía.{please stop doing the thing where your things in a list aren't of the same kind}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, dinner's ready.}Kou, la cena está lista.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.47,0:05:59.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm not at a good stopping point yet, so eat without me.}No es bueno dejar esto a medías,\N puedes cenar sin mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, again?}¿Qué? ¿Otra vez?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.64,0:06:05.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're making Mom lonely.}Haces que mamá se sienta sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.85,0:06:08.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What are you saying?}¿Qué estás diciendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.01,0:06:13.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You say that now, but you'll be thanking me once I get my first paycheck.}Eso dices ahora, pero me agradecerás una vez que consiga mi primera paga.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.00,0:06:18.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm not too concerned about that.}No me preocupa mucho eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.60,0:06:24.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Eating dinner or watching TV together is a lot more important to me.}Cenar y ver televisión juntos es más importante para mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.57,0:06:34.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mom...}Mamá...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.29,0:06:40.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I...}Me...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.98,0:06:44.39,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...made a mistake.}equivoqué... {in the general sense, I don't really want to use "wrong" here}{"made a mistake" is one of the acceptable "literal" translations of machigau anyway so what}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.22,0:06:52.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry...}Perdón...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.65,0:06:56.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Estaba tan desesperado que perdí de vista todo,\N excepto mi meta.{}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.53,0:06:59.95,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But that was a mistake.}Pero eso fue una equivocación.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.73,0:07:04.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I should've focused on what was really important.}Debí enfocarme en lo que de verdad era importante.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But it's too late now.}Pero ya es demasiado tarde.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.97,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{No one is available to answer at this time.\an8}La persona a quien intenta llamar, no está disponible.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.76,0:07:36.45,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Please leave your name and a short message after the beep.\an8}Por favor, deje su nombre y su mensaje después del tono.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs30\fscy120\fsp-1\bord0\shad0\c&H3DE8B8&\fnKozuka Gothic Pr6N M\frz356.7\fax-0.86\pos(544.778,351.111)}Tanaka Kouichi
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Hey, it's your brother...\an8}Eh, habla tu hermano...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.52,0:07:44.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou, are you there?\an8}Kou, ¿estás ahí?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I just heard from Mom.\an8}Acabo de escuchar lo de mamá.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.78,0:07:55.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou, I'm leaving Mom in your hands.\fad(100,100)}Kou, dejaré a mamá en tus manos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm s-sorry...}L-Lo siento...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.89,0:08:08.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry...}Lo siento...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.16,0:08:11.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry.}Lo siento.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry!}¡Lo siento!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm so sorry!}¡Lo siento!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry!}¡¡Lo siento tanto!!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.71,0:08:19.86,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.75,0:08:29.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yoshioka? Oh yeah...}¿Yoshioka? Ah, sí...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.81,0:08:32.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Are we playing cops and robbers?}¿Jugaremos policías y ladrones?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.81,0:08:36.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Man, that's a heck of a face she's running over with.\fad(0,250)}Rayos, qué expresión pone cuando corre.{Shiki: En buen sentido lo dice}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.72,0:08:46.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My neck kills...}Qué dolor...{ de huevos}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Kou.}Oye, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.10,0:09:24.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.54,0:09:28.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What're you spacing out for?}¿Por qué sueñas despierto?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.11,0:09:29.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{C'mon, let's go.}Ya, vamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.49,0:09:33.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We know you don't have work today.}Sabemos que hoy no trabajas.{wait, does he even have a job?}{nope}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.96,0:09:37.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That means you can study all we want.}Eso significa que puedes estudiar\N con nosotros todo lo que queramos.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here we go! Here we go!}¡Aquí vamos! ¡Aquí vamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.08,0:09:47.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun, what subject do you want to start with?}Mabuchi-kun, ¿con qué asignatura quieres comenzar?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Whatever you want.}La que ustedes quieran.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.34,0:09:56.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll take that to mean that you're open to anything.}Tomaré eso como que estás dispuesto a lo que sea.{lit. I like your dedication to do anything today}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.07,0:09:59.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, right, I brought the latest in my math notes series.}Ah, cierto. Traje mis últimos apuntes de matemáticas.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I made a chemistry one for you, too.}También hice uno de química para ti.{Shiki: Química con maysúcula?}{nah}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.12,0:10:16.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm gonna go to the bathroom before we start.}Iré al baño primero.{"stop at" is more A->(bathroom)->B movement, whereas this is A->(bathroom)->A (well, what he says, at least)}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure thing, see ya.}Bueno, suerte con eso{#perry}.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.15,0:10:31.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun's been gone for a while.}Mabuchi-kun se está tardando.{Mabuchi-kun debió irse por el retrete}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.31,0:10:35.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's he doing in there?}¿Qué tanto estará haciendo?{Vayan a decirle que ya le corte}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.18,0:10:39.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Didn't he just go home?}¿No se habrá ido a casa?{¿De verdad se iría por el retrete?}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.07,0:10:40.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.31,0:10:43.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, he's probably just taking a big one.}Oh, vamos, tal vez tenía muchas ganas.{No me gustaba lo otro...}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.27,0:10:45.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So why's his bag gone?}Entonces ¿por qué no está su mochila?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.06,0:10:46.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is it really?}¿De veras?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.53,0:10:52.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He tricked us!}¡Nos engañó!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.05,0:10:54.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I knew he was a brat.}Sabía que era un maldito.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You won't get away!}¡No te escaparás!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go!}¡Vámonos!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.83,0:11:01.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If we leave now, we can still catch him!}¡Podemos alcanzarlo si nos vamos ahora!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Ah, sor—}Ah, perd—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.47,0:11:09.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{S-Sorry abou—}P-Perdón por—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.67,0:11:19.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm so sorry!}¡En serio lo siento!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.65,0:11:21.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, Futaba-chan!}¡Espera, Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.31,0:11:25.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why is this happening?!}¡¿Por qué me pasa esto?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.61,0:11:29.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What an unfortunate accident.}Vaya accidente.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.57,0:11:31.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A bit} {\i1}{too}{\i0} {unfortunate.}Un tanto desafortunado.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.58,0:11:35.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Damn, he got away.}Diablos, se nos peló.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.65,0:11:40.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He seemed really out of it today.}Se notaba muy distraído hoy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, there was something strange about him.}Sí, actuaba algo extraño.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.97,0:11:46.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Can't figure the guy out.}No entiendo a ese tipo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.26,0:11:50.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't you get the feeling he's keeping something big to himself?}¿No sienten que esconde algo importante?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.64,0:11:58.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just when I thought we were getting closer to him, he pushes us away again.}Justo cuando nos estábamos acercando \Nun poco más, se echa para atrás de nuevo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's just like a cat.}Es como un gato.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sounds about right.}Tienes razón.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.46,0:12:09.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He probably doesn't even know what he wants. He's not the brightest.}Quizás no sabe ni lo que quiere.\N Solo es un tonto.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Still, I can't help but like him.}Pero aun así me agrada.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.04,0:12:18.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm gonna drag him around all summer vacation.}{Lo arrastraré todo el verano.}{Dios, eso se lee no sé qcio}No me le despegaré en todo el verano.{LOL}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'd love for us all to go somewhere together.}Me encantaría ir a algún lugar con ustedes.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.26,0:12:24.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Like the movies, or an amusement park...}Como ir al cine, o a un parque de diversiones...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.34,0:12:28.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh! We could go hiking again like during the leadership course!}{was this always capitalized?}¡Ah! ¡Podríamos hacer otra excursión\N como hicimos durante el curso de liderazgo!{no, fixed}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.87,0:12:31.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure, as long as we don't get lost again.}Claro, mientras no nos perdamos otra vez.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.44,0:12:36.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, well... that time, um...}Ah, bueno... Esa vez, eh...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.64,0:12:39.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou, we're all waiting for you.}Kou, todos te estamos esperando.{No, putito}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.70,0:12:45.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's a bright and cheerful world right outside your door.}Hay un mundo radiante y alegre justo afuera de tu puerta.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why won't you come out?}¿Por qué no sales?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Come out! Get out here, Kou!}¡Sal! ¡Sal de ahí, Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{We're all waiting!}¡Te estamos esperando!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, Tanaka-sensei.}Ah, Tanaka-sensei.{I like his shirt}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you're looking for Kou, he's not back yet.}Si estás buscando a Kou, él aún no ha llegado. {Kou isn't back yet}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.47,0:13:11.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sensei, Kou-kun won't open the door to his heart!}¡Sensei, Kou-kun no quiere abrir la puerta de su corazón!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.89,0:13:15.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He keeps opening all these other doors to me,}Él me abre todas sus puertas,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.03,0:13:20.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but the one I really want opened is locked tight.}pero la que realmente quiero\N abrir está cerrada firmemente.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.44,0:13:23.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Behind a double lock, even.}Incluso con doble seguro.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.27,0:13:29.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is that so? I think you're a bit off, though.}Ya veo. Pero creo que te equivocas.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.87,0:13:33.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If we're going to go with your metaphor,}Si usamos tu metáfora,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.23,0:13:38.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{it's more like he didn't even give the door a doorknob, never mind a lock.}entonces, creo que ni siquiera le puso el \Npestillo a su puerta, mucho menos un seguro.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.14,0:13:45.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sensei, what should I do now?}Sensei, ¿qué debería hacer ahora?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.48,0:13:48.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Onii-chan doesn't have a clue either.}Onii-chan tampoco tiene una pista.{"El hermano mayor"?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then I'll just have to smash that door to pieces!}¡Entonces solo tendré que romper esa puerta en pedazos!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That damn brat!}¡Ese maldito!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.54,0:14:04.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Just like how Kou opened the door to my heart, I can open his!}¡Del mismo modo que Kou abrió{mis piernas} mi corazón, \Nyo puedo abrir el suyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She's like a storm.}Es como una tormenta.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.01,0:14:28.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, it's time to come out.}Kou, es hora de salir.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.78,0:14:31.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Open your door.}Abre tu puerta.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.55,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He's here! He's really here!}¡Ahí está! ¡En serio está ahí!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.13,0:15:10.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You know what they did next?}¿Y qué hicieron después?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Seriously?}¿En serio?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.39,0:15:18.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If you want someone to talk with, then I'm right here.}Si quieres a alguien con quien hablar,\N conmigo debería bastar.{<3}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.81,0:15:24.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{A-And Kominato-kun and Yuuri are, too.}T-También con Kominato-kun y Yuuri. {AHR #08 [0:19:38.18]}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.31,0:15:25.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.98,0:15:27.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Kou!}¡Oye, Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.61,0:15:31.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are we too boring for you or something?}¿Te estamos aburriendo demasiado o algo?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.16,0:15:32.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, man.}Lo siento, chicos.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.74,0:15:37.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nah, don't worry. That's just what Kou's like.}No te preocupes, Kou es así.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's always like this.}Siempre ha sido así.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{For real?}¿En serio?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.46,0:15:44.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Actually, you haven't been around much lately.}De hecho, no has pasado mucho por aquí últimamente.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.17,0:15:47.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Got something nice in your life?}¿Habrá llegado algo interesante a tu vida?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, not really.}No, no realmente.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.22,0:15:57.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.52,0:16:13.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Again she comes running, with that dumb look on her face.}Otra vez viene corriendo \Ncon esa expresión en su rostro.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.62,0:16:24.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I told you not to go there by yourself.}Te dije que no fueras por esos rumbos tú sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.88,0:16:32.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, how long are you going to keep this up?}Kou, ¿por cuánto tiempo seguirás con esto?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.55,0:16:34.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Keep what up?}¿Seguir con qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.93,0:16:40.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Keep everything up! Everything you're doing right now.}¡Pues con todo! ¡Seguir con todo lo que estás haciendo!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.78,0:16:59.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Doesn't it tire you out?}¿No te cansa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.91,0:17:02.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's the point of it?}¿Cuál es el punto?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.08,0:17:08.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There is no point.}No hay un punto.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.30,0:17:14.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nothing I do has a point.}Nada de lo que hago tiene un punto.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.09,0:17:18.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You probably can't understand with your "start over from step one" attitude.}Probablemente no lo entiendas con tu actitud de "empezar desde cero".
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.18,0:17:22.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know that...}Lo sé...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.35,0:17:26.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But if she saw you like this,}Pero es que si ella te viera así,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.06,0:17:30.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm sure your mother would be sad—}estoy segura que tu madre se entris—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You don't need to tell me.}No tienes que decírmelo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The thought of it tortures me day and night.}Pensar en ello me tortura día y noche.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.78,0:17:41.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But that kind of thinking won't solve anything.}Pero ese tipo de pensamiento no resolverá nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.33,0:17:48.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Even if I realized all the mistakes I've made, I can't do it over.}Aun si descubro todos los errores que he cometido, no puedo arreglarlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.96,0:17:55.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I watched my mother grow thinner by the day}Vi a mi madre apagarse día tras día,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.42,0:17:59.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{as she resigned herself to her fate.}como resignándose a su propio destino.{I think you misinterpreted this line -- it's part of the same sentence as the next two lines. These two lines are "At the side of my mother, who acted as though she were preparing for death as she grew thinner by the day"}{I know, but I tried to get around it}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.64,0:18:04.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What I felt back then...}Lo que sentí en aquel momento... {I'd like to swap these lines but they're just too long}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.81,0:18:11.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...you will never understand.}nunca lo entenderías.{this is a perfectly acceptable sentence}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.52,0:18:17.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But you know, sometimes things just don't go your way.}Pero, ya sabes, las cosas no siempre salen como quieres.{Haru 03 línea 2362 en adelante}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.40,0:18:20.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's when you go back to step one.}Así que comenzaré desde cero.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{And there's nothing wrong with that.}¡Creo que es lo mejor!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm glad.}Me alegro.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.25,0:18:35.34,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou is suffering as much now as he did then.}Kou está sufriendo tanto como en ese momento.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.88,0:18:41.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No one but Kou himself will ever fully understand his feelings.}Nadie más que él entenderá realmente sus sentimientos.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.85,0:18:44.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No matter how hard I try,}No importa cuánto lo intente,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.72,0:18:47.10,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{it'll never be enough.}nunca será suficiente.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But still...}Pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.98,0:18:52.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But still!}Pero aun así...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I want to understand you with all of my heart.}Quiero entenderte con todo mi corazón.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.82,0:19:03.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is that really so wrong?}¿Tan malo es eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I just want to smash it to pieces.}Solo quiero romperla en pedazos.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.33,0:19:14.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to smash that damned door to bits!}¡Quiero volver añicos esa maldita puerta!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.76,0:19:21.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why...}¿Por qué...?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.89,0:19:30.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why are you trying to hard to break in?}¿Por qué estás tratando tanto en romperla? {UGH}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not just you. Everyone.}No solo tú. Todos.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.49,0:19:42.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm scared of that.}Me da miedo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.45,0:19:46.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, wait! Sto—}¡Oye, espera! Pa{rá}—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.96,0:19:56.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Th-That was terrifying.}E-Eso fue aterrorizante.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She's heavy...}Es muy pesada...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.05,0:20:03.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's too late!}¡Ya es muy tarde!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.35,0:20:11.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you feel scared, then that means you already see us as precious!}¡Si en serio estás asustado, entonces eso\N quiere decir que ya somos importantes para ti!{next episode previews are not binding}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.60,0:20:15.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're scared to lose us, aren't you?}Tienes miedo de perdernos, ¿no es cierto?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.07,0:20:21.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You really know how to be annoying.}Realmente sabes cómo ser molesta.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.32,0:20:27.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you've lost so much already that no one thing can ever replace it,}Si has perdido tanto que ya\N ninguna cosa podría reemplazarlo,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.24,0:20:30.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{you just have to grab as much as you can.}entonces solo tienes que tomar tantas como puedas.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.83,0:20:36.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{They might be so small that it takes tens or hundreds of them, but when you've found enough...}Podrán ser pequeñas, tal vez requieras decenas\N o cientos de ellas, pero cuando tengas suficientes...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.46,0:20:42.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...you'll finally want to live again!}¡finalmente querrás vivir otra vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:49.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's perfectly fine to get too into something or to laugh like an idiot.}Está perfectamente bien involucrarse\N mucho en algo o reírse como un idiota. {<3}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:53.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And if anyone says otherwise, I'll beat them up!}¡Y si alguien dice lo contrario, le daré una paliza!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.45,0:21:09.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Oh... she's right...}Ah... ella tiene razón...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{All I wanted...}Todo lo que quería...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:16.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...was to be able to live and laugh freely.}era ser capaz de vivir y reír libremente.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:20.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Someone to tell me it was okay...}Alguien que me diga que está bien...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...to have meaning in my life.}tener un significado en mi vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.69,0:21:43.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I really have been...}Realmente estuve...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.65,0:21:49.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...waiting for a storm like her to come.}esperando que una tormenta como ella llegara.
