Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.21,0:23:28.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See you tomorrow!}¡Nos vemos mañana!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.55,0:23:30.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, see you at school.}Sí, te veo en la escuela.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.38,0:23:32.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yep, see you!}¡Sí{p}, nos vemos!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.14,0:23:34.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.39,0:23:36.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks.}Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.68,0:23:39.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah!}¡De nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs50\bord0\shad0\c&H43413F&\fnNote this\frz343.2\pos(319,247)\b0}Tú puedes, Kou\NTermina todo esto\Ny todo estará OK\NAya
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H43413F&\fnNote this\b0\frz14.32\pos(748.429,133.857)}¡No te pases el verano\N\h\h\h\hencerrado haciendo tareas!\NFutaba
